      "en": "“Speak to the children of Israel, and tell them that they should make themselves fringes on the borders of their garments throughout their generations, and that they put on the fringe of each border a cord of blue.",
      "ko": "이스라엘 자손에게 명하여 그들의 대대로 그 옷단 귀에 술을 만들고 청색 끈을 그 귀의 술에 더하라",
      "source_text_hash": "26d50dfb80ec1ba70dd2964a7a1f82f31b382fce3b705fe2f7c807e369cf3bee",
      "translation_text_hash": "2425455f3bfe79240eb3dc384d51df5d41f3820aeaa9ba61b3954452a54ff8c5",
